          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "へちまさんが泊まりにきた。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "へちまさん来家里住了一晚。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Hechima came to stay over."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "スプラトゥーン2のフェスはじまるからね🦑"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "因为《斯普拉遁2》的祭典要开始了嘛🦑"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The Splatoon 2 Splatfest is starting 🦑"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "写真はジャイロな動きにめげずに、へちまさんの手に乗り続ける文鳥ちゃん。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "照片里是面对陀螺仪般的晃动也不退缩、一直稳稳待在へちまさん手上的文鸟酱。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "In the photo, my Java sparrow keeps standing on Hechima's hand, undaunted by the gyro-like movements."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "女好きな文鳥ちゃんにジェラシー"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "对爱撩妹的文鸟酱表示吃醋"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I'm jealous of my womanizing Java sparrow"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "飼い主に似たのか…\n"
          },
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "eb715039f087.png",
            "source": "https://parts.lineblog.me/img/emoji/line/1/00048.png"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "大概是随了主人吧……"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Maybe it takes after its owner…"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "鹿乃"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "titleZh": "我是魔法师派的！",
    "titleEn": "I'm Team Wizard!"
